1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,553
Seorang ratu melangkah masuk

2
00:00:01,573 --> 00:00:03,271
istana, lalu menyingkap

3
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:04,354
kainnya karena mengira

4
00:00:04,374 --> 00:00:05,290
lantainya air.

5
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,596
Ternyata itu kaca.

6
00:00:06,616 --> 00:00:08,646
Surah An-Naml.

7
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:09,900
Ratu negeri Saba menerima

8
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,401
surat dari Nabi Sulaiman:

9
00:00:11,421 --> 00:00:12,655
dengan nama Allah Yang Maha

10
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:14,468
Pengasih, Maha Penyayang.

11
00:00:14,488 --> 00:00:15,799
Janganlah kalian sombong,

12
00:00:15,819 --> 00:00:16,805
datanglah dengan berserah

13
00:00:16,825 --> 00:00:17,308
diri.

14
00:00:17,328 --> 00:00:18,674
Ia tidak tergesa.

15
00:00:18,694 --> 00:00:19,757
Ia bermusyawarah dengan para

16
00:00:19,777 --> 00:00:20,516
pembesarnya.

17
00:00:20,536 --> 00:00:21,259
Mereka berkata:

18
00:00:21,279 --> 00:00:22,513
kita kuat dan berani

19
00:00:22,533 --> 00:00:23,209
berperang.

20
00:00:23,229 --> 00:00:24,093
Ia menjawab:

21
00:00:24,113 --> 00:00:25,595
raja-raja, bila memasuki

22
00:00:25,615 --> 00:00:26,616
sebuah negeri,

23
00:00:26,636 --> 00:00:27,715
merusaknya.

24
00:00:27,735 --> 00:00:28,954
Maka ia memilih mengirim

25
00:00:28,974 --> 00:00:30,368
hadiah, lalu menunggu.

26
00:00:30,388 --> 00:00:32,031
Sulaiman menolak hadiah itu:

27
00:00:32,051 --> 00:00:32,990
apa yang Allah berikan

28
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,431
kepadaku lebih baik.

29
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:35,690
Lalu ia bertanya:

30
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:36,743
siapa yang sanggup membawa

31
00:00:36,763 --> 00:00:38,141
singgasana ratu itu kemari?

32
00:00:38,161 --> 00:00:39,584
Seorang yang memiliki ilmu

33
00:00:39,604 --> 00:00:40,916
dari Kitab berkata:

34
00:00:40,936 --> 00:00:42,464
aku membawanya sebelum matamu

35
00:00:42,484 --> 00:00:43,122
berkedip.

36
00:00:43,142 --> 00:00:44,236
Singgasana itu pun ada di

37
00:00:44,256 --> 00:00:44,967
hadapannya.

38
00:00:44,987 --> 00:00:46,177
Sulaiman berkata:

39
00:00:46,197 --> 00:00:47,631
ini karunia Tuhanku,

40
00:00:47,651 --> 00:00:48,855
untuk mengujiku,

41
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:50,144
apakah aku bersyukur.

42
00:00:50,164 --> 00:00:51,918
Singgasana itu diubah.

43
00:00:51,938 --> 00:00:53,203
Saat sang ratu datang,

44
00:00:53,223 --> 00:00:54,181
ia ditanya:

45
00:00:54,201 --> 00:00:55,749
serupa inikah singgasanamu?

46
00:00:55,769 --> 00:00:56,779
Jawabnya cerdas:

47
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:58,461
seakan-akan itulah dia.

48
00:00:58,481 --> 00:01:00,256
Tidak terburu membenarkan,

49
00:01:00,276 --> 00:01:01,938
tidak terburu menyangkal.

50
00:01:01,958 --> 00:01:04,590
Lalu ia diminta masuk istana.

51
00:01:04,610 --> 00:01:05,812
Dikiranya kolam air,

52
00:01:05,832 --> 00:01:07,283
ternyata lantai yang dilapisi

53
00:01:07,303 --> 00:01:08,053
kaca.

54
00:01:08,073 --> 00:01:09,079
Ia berkata:

55
00:01:09,099 --> 00:01:10,302
aku berserah diri bersama

56
00:01:10,322 --> 00:01:11,840
Sulaiman kepada Allah,

57
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:13,071
Tuhan seluruh alam.

58
00:01:13,091 --> 00:01:14,511
Ia tidak tunduk pada ancaman

59
00:01:14,531 --> 00:01:16,167
pasukan, tapi pada kebenaran

60
00:01:16,187 --> 00:01:17,488
yang ia lihat sendiri.

61
00:01:17,508 --> 00:01:18,790
Menurut kamu,

62
00:01:18,810 --> 00:01:20,300
apa yang membuatnya berubah?

63
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,554
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

64
00:01:21,574 --> 00:01:22,717
bersama AUDIRA.

